1
00:00:00,345 --> 00:00:05,900
Welcome to PremaDesk. This walkthrough shows how a
receptionist can manage bookings,

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,302
guest records, and cash
payments.

3
00:00:08,807 --> 00:00:14,011
Enter your email and password, then select Sign in. If you
work at more than one

4
00:00:14,011 --> 00:00:16,964
hotel, choose the right one from
Property.

5
00:00:17,468 --> 00:00:24,650
Start on Overview to see what needs attention today. Check
the arrivals, departures, and rooms ready for guests.

6
00:00:25,153 --> 00:00:31,407
Select View reservations to open the booking list, or Room
inventory to check individual rooms.

7
00:00:31,908 --> 00:00:37,713
On Rooms, use Find a room to search by number or room type.
Check the rate, capacity,

8
00:00:37,713 --> 00:00:41,143
and housekeeping status before a
guest arrives.

9
00:00:41,644 --> 00:00:47,273
Before recording a cash payment, open Cash desk. The opening
float is the cash already

10
00:00:47,273 --> 00:00:50,766
in the till, including money set
aside for change.

11
00:00:51,275 --> 00:00:55,738
Enter the opening float in Ghana cedis and select Open
shift.

12
00:00:56,240 --> 00:01:03,667
To book a stay, select New reservation, enter the arrival
and departure dates, then select Find rooms.

13
00:01:04,169 --> 00:01:10,091
Search for an existing guest profile, or enter a name to
create a new profile with the booking.

14
00:01:10,592 --> 00:01:17,788
Choose an available room, select Confirm reservation, and
check the details in the pop-up before confirming.

15
00:01:18,289 --> 00:01:24,062
To find a booking later, search by guest name or filter by
status. When the guest arrives

16
00:01:24,062 --> 00:01:26,811
and the room is ready, select
Check in.

17
00:01:27,315 --> 00:01:34,020
If a booking is cancelled, select Cancel booking and
confirm. A booking with a cash payment still on its folio

18
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:36,860
must be settled before it can be cancelled.

19
00:01:37,365 --> 00:01:41,566
Select Folio on the booking to review the guest’s charges
and balance.

20
00:01:42,072 --> 00:01:49,176
To add an extra, such as laundry, enter the description and
amount, then select Post charge and confirm.

21
00:01:49,682 --> 00:01:56,058
Enter how much to apply to the balance and how much cash the
guest handed you. Select Record cash payment.

22
00:01:56,561 --> 00:02:01,479
Check the change shown in the pop-up and confirm. You can
then print the receipt.

23
00:02:01,984 --> 00:02:06,977
Once the balance is paid, select Check out on the booking
when the guest leaves.

24
00:02:07,483 --> 00:02:12,755
Open Guests to find a returning guest, or select Add guest
to create a profile.

25
00:02:13,255 --> 00:02:19,646
Use View details to see their contact information and stay
history, including room numbers.

26
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:25,239
Choose Edit to update a phone number or note a preference
for a future stay.

27
00:02:25,742 --> 00:02:31,897
Return to Cash desk, count the cash in the till, and enter
the total under Cash counted.

28
00:02:32,398 --> 00:02:38,294
Select Close shift. Compare the counted amount with the
expected amount to see whether there’s a difference.

29
00:02:38,801 --> 00:02:44,431
To change your password, open Change password. Enter your
current password and confirm a

30
00:02:44,431 --> 00:02:47,210
new one with at least twelve
characters.

31
00:02:47,711 --> 00:02:52,086
Select Update password, then sign in again with the new
password.

32
00:02:52,588 --> 00:02:56,347
When you finish using PremaDesk, select Sign out.
